manage project/meeting

Usage:
  mdql project meeting [command]

Available Commands:
  add         create project/meeting
  delete      delete project/meeting
  list        list project/meeting
  show        show project/meeting
  update      update project/meeting

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for meeting

Global Flags:
  -f, --format string   output: table|json|csv|tsv
      --no-sync         skip stale-index check on open
  -q, --quiet           IDs only
      --root string     store root (default ".")
      --schema string   schema file path (default "./schema.yml")

Use "mdql project meeting [command] --help" for more information about a command.
